abstract: >-
  An open book of executed Jupyter notebooks, with a small Python module, on
  the Onsager variational principle in soft matter: the Rayleighian, Onsager's
  kinetic equations and reciprocal relations, how to write free energies and
  dissipation functions, the derivation of the diffusion, Stokes and Darcy
  equations, and the approximation method with trial functions. Every
  variational result is checked against an exact or numerical solution.
